		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Ant-centaur with long, red antennae and insect-like mandibles. Formian leaders.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 23, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 sting +3 (1d8 + poison) and 1 claw +3 (1d4) or 1 spell +3, <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Baffle (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 13. Focus. One target in near of LV 4 or less is dazed for the duration.</p><p></p><p><strong>Flame Bolt (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 12. One target in far takes 2d6 damage. Summon Giant Ant (CHA Spell). DC 14. Summon 2d4 loyal giant ants that appear within near. They stay for 5 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Poison</strong>. CON 12+ or paralyzed 1d4 DEX damage, paralyzed at 0 DEX.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
